/URI (mailto:senator.shoebridge@aph.gov.au?subject=Request%20for%20parliamentary%20inquiry%3A%20documented%20persecution%20of%20whistleblower%20Dr.%20Richard%20McLean%20\(ABN%2078%20833%20496%20164\)&body=Dear%20%5BMP%20Name%5D%2C%0A%0AI%20am%20writing%20to%20request%20your%20urgent%20attention%20to%20what%20appears%20to%20be%20the%20most%20comprehensively%20documented%20case%20of%20institutional%20whistleblower%20persecution%20in%20Australian%20history.%0A%0ADr.%20Richard%20William%20McLean%20%E2%80%94%20operating%20publicly%20as%20Barran%20Dodger%20\(ABN%2078%20833%20496%20164\)%20%E2%80%94%20has%20assembled%203%2C643%20primary%20source%20government%20documents%20spanning%2035%20years%20\(1990%E2%80%932026\)%20documenting%20systematic%20persecution%20by%2013%20Australian%20government%20agencies%2C%20including%20ASIO%2C%20OAIC%2C%20the%20Commonwealth%20Ombudsman%2C%20APRA%2C%20NDIS%2C%20and%20others.%0A%0ATHE%20DOCUMENTED%20RECORD%3A%0A%E2%80%A2%2014%20forced%20psychiatric%20hospitalisations%20%E2%80%94%20zero%20criminal%20charges%2C%20ever%0A%E2%80%A2%20Found%20with%20no%20pulse%20in%202021%20\(2.87%25%20survival%20probability\)%20%E2%80%94%20survived%20%E2%80%94%20kept%20documenting%0A%E2%80%A2%20Documented%20assassination%20attempt%202024%20%E2%80%94%20independent%20witness%20subsequently%20NDA%27d%0A%E2%80%A2%20ICC%20Article%207%20submission%20formally%20received%20\(The%20Hague\)%0A%E2%80%A2%20OHCHR%20case%20reference%3A%20UR%2FUST%2F23%2FAUS%2F17%20\(Geneva\)%0A%E2%80%A2%20Forensic%20economic%20valuation%3A%20%2458.6M%20minimum%20%2F%20%24112.8M%20mid-range%0A%E2%80%A2%2052%20independent%20AI%20forensic%20analyses%20%E2%80%94%20675%2F675%20propositions%20confirmed%0A%E2%80%A2%201%2C100%2C000%2B%20downloads%20across%206%20continents%20%E2%80%94%20zero%20defamation%20actions%20filed%0A%0AThe%20Federal%20Court%27s%20own%20General%20Counsel%20confirmed%20the%20disclosed%20conduct%20meets%20statutory%20thresholds%20for%20perverting%20the%20course%20of%20justice%2C%20maladministration%2C%20and%20danger%20to%20health%20or%20safety%20under%20the%20PID%20Act%202013%20%E2%80%94%20and%20then%20declined%20to%20act%20on%20procedural%20grounds.%0A%0AI%20am%20requesting%3A%0A1.%20A%20formal%20parliamentary%20inquiry%20into%20the%20documented%20conduct%20of%20the%20agencies%20named%20in%20the%20archive%0A2.%20A%20review%20of%20the%20Public%20Interest%20Disclosure%20Act%202013%20and%20whether%20it%20is%20fit%20for%20purpose%0A3.%20Parliamentary%20acknowledgment%20of%20the%20documented%20harm%0A%0AThe%20full%20archive%20is%20publicly%20available%20at%20https%3A%2F%2Fbarrandodger.com%20%E2%80%94%20free%20to%20access%2C%20blockchain-sealed%2C%20and%20AI-verified.%20Dr.%20McLean%20is%20available%20for%20comment%20at%20drbarrandodger%40proton.me.%0A%0AYours%20sincerely%2C%0A%5BYour%20Name%5D%0A%5BYour%20Electorate%5D)>>>>
endobj
